Description: The CARE1 package, the first part of the program CARE
    (Capture-Recapture), can be used to analyze epidemiological data
    via a sample coverage approach (Chao et al. 2001a).
    Based on records from several incomplete lists or samples of
    individuals, CARE1 provides population size estimates and
    related statistics. The maximum number of lists is five.
